              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نخست (nakhost) — \"first, firstly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نخست (nakhost) نامه را خواند و بعد گریه کرد. Nakhost nâme râ khând va ba'd gerye kard. First she read the letter, and then she cried."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literary; nakhost vazir \"prime minister\". In speech avval."
            }
          ]
        },
